### kingdom), the prompt (you@kingdom), /etc/hosts, ~/.ssh/config, the keys
### (~/.ssh/id_kingdom), /etc/hostname. The engine's identifier is the
### English name; each language gives a valid host name: lowercase letters,
### digits and hyphens, no accents or spaces (RFC 1123), easy to type.

